      "dom_id": "step-q342226",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Evaluate $\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(-3).$ **Do not round** your answer.\n\n$\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(-3)=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{-3}\\,+$ {{field-1}} $)$",
      "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x$ is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(-1) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{-3}+{e}^{-(-3)}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{-3}+{e}^{3}).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
