      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "Evaluate $\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\sqrt{2}).$ **Do not round** your answer.\n\n$\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\sqrt{2})=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{2}}\\,-$ {{field-1}} $)$",
      "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\sqrt{2}) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{2}}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{2}}).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
