    "q-95493": {
      "dom_id": "step-q95493",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "Given that $y\\ge 0,$ which of the following is equivalent to $\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\sqrt{y}?$",
      "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\sqrt{y})=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{y}}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{y}}).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95493-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{y}}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{y}})",
