ta-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
